  "limits": "Eight rotated multi-arm blocks; bootstrap resamples seven jointly clean blocks 10000 times, seed 7317. Whole-invocation CPU and guest IRQ/softirq deltas divided by scored payload. Counted interrupts and NET_RX/NET_TX entries are not work time. No per-arm interface drop snapshots. Distinct services and endpoint ports remain a possible confound. Timing was acquired on the historical guest.",
